# Tribunal "Barilzar's Mazed Band": Gavas Drin, asked again about service to our
# Lady, sends the player to Fedris Hler (10), who wants Barilzar's ring found
# ("service to our Lady", then "Barilzar's Mazed Band": 20). The lich Barilzar
# in the Abandoned Crypt force-greets once the player is within 512
# (barilzarScript), refuses (60) and fights. The player walks in from the
# crypt's inner door after his script has bound, as a player would arrive.
# Holding the ring logs 70 (mazedbandScript); Gavas sends the player on to Almalexia (90), who takes it
# in the High Chapel ("It is my pleasure to serve you." 2: 100).
# The kill stands in for the fight, and taking his things for looting him. Ref
# FormIDs carry Tribunal.esm's slot 06.
# Run: python -m tools.live.test_instance mwtest --cases <this folder> --fast --checkpoints --stop-on-fail --load mwtest_tr_shrine_dead --timeout 2400
# See docs/commentary/headless_testing.md#quest-runs

case tr_mazed_band
run
player->PositionCell -1120 100 -229 0 "Mournhold Temple: Office of the Lord Archcanon"
until 600 "gavas drin"->GetDistance player < 400
talk gavas drin
ask service to our Lady
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 10
bye
run
player->PositionCell -116 483 -684 0 "Mournhold Temple: Reception Area"
until 600 "fedris hler"->GetDistance player < 400
talk fedris hler
ask service to our Lady
ask Barilzar's Mazed Band
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 20
bye
run
player->PositionCell -2411 336 -12 0 "Old Mournhold: Abandoned Crypt"
until 300 GetPCCell "Old Mournhold: Abandoned Crypt" == 1
wait 300
walk -5030 1603 471
until 600 MenuMode == 1
bye
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 60
defend
console 064C404B.kill
until 600 GetDeadCount "lich_barilzar" >= 1
console 064C404B.removeallitems player
until 300 GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 70
run
player->PositionCell -1120 100 -229 0 "Mournhold Temple: Office of the Lord Archcanon"
until 600 "gavas drin"->GetDistance player < 400
talk gavas drin
ask Barilzar's Mazed Band
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 90
bye
run
player->PositionCell 1 49 -659 0 "Mournhold Temple: High Chapel"
until 600 "almalexia"->GetDistance player < 400
talk almalexia
ask Barilzar's Mazed Band
choose 2
expect GetJournalIndex TR_MazedBand == 100
bye
end
